{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo is fully feature complete and comparable to the full game, being set in an exclusive level only playable in the demo. Learn the basics of the game in the tutorial, and solve 4 unique Cairn Stacks  in the bespoke level set in rural Outback Australia. As development of the full game continues, this demo will get improvements and updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is <i>Cairns</i>?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cairns</i> is the exemplary stone balancing simulation game. Travel to diverse and breathtaking outdoor environments, where each Cairn Stack is a self contained physics puzzle requiring Balance, Patience and Perfection to solve and progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811000/extras/b7c9688350e2ff855c35d58403ebdc6e.poster.avif?t=1759340303\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811000/extras/b7c9688350e2ff855c35d58403ebdc6e.webm?t=1759340303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811000/extras/b7c9688350e2ff855c35d58403ebdc6e.mp4?t=1759340303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cairns</i> features over 100 hand-crafted puzzling Stacks to solve and complete, across 5 glorious outdoor environments, offering\u00a0a significant amount to play, learn and master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself into the ancient practice of building Cairns, in an environmentally safe and non-destructive way. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the rewarding satisfaction of balancing the physics simulated stones in a freestanding Stack to reach the target height, unlocking greater challenges and new environments.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on achievement through intuitive controls and improved quality of life features like Undo / Redo and Pinning Stones in place.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immortalize and share your success of perfection with Photo mode, or just take in the glory of nature with full Environment Controls</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Balance</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The foundation of achieving success in <i>Cairns</i> is achieving Balance. Maintaining the placement of each stone, their order, and the center of gravity is necessary to complete each Cairn Stack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811000/extras/d87734f7e013cfa4d14475f4713d78b1.poster.avif?t=1759340303\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811000/extras/d87734f7e013cfa4d14475f4713d78b1.webm?t=1759340303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811000/extras/d87734f7e013cfa4d14475f4713d78b1.mp4?t=1759340303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accurately simulated real time physics makes balancing stones intuitive, and every Cairn Stack has been carefully designed to be challenging yet achievable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Patience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patience is necessary to overcome the hurdles and frustrations of failure, and push through to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An emphasis on designing a high quality of life experience is at the heart of <i>Cairns</i>, making mistakes educational rather than painful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811000/extras/0fd1820edd3b8acba063dcab500da86e.poster.avif?t=1759340303\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811000/extras/0fd1820edd3b8acba063dcab500da86e.webm?t=1759340303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811000/extras/0fd1820edd3b8acba063dcab500da86e.mp4?t=1759340303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What makes <i>Cairns</i> pleasant and flowing are features like</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive camera and Stone controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undo and Redo </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pinning Stones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-saving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photo Mode and Environment Controls</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Perfection</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Striving for Perfection, and achieving it, is the most satisfying measure of ability. It is not enough to simply reach a Stack's goal height. Challenge yourself to go above and beyond, perhaps using every stone, or the least amount of stones, as quickly as possible, or with as few moves as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811000/extras/6d9c883c04a123db96841b4d47637781.poster.avif?t=1759340303\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811000/extras/6d9c883c04a123db96841b4d47637781.webm?t=1759340303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811000/extras/6d9c883c04a123db96841b4d47637781.mp4?t=1759340303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow things down and focus. <i>Cairns</i> is the perfect<i>\u00a0</i>game to lose yourself in, and promises a calm, mindful, challenging and rewarding experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3811000?t=1759340303","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811000/b493805e30f0a201dff3dbb6118a0f823c4d569e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759340303","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811000/470d4fb6e395e70afa201065e49554644e69e5aa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759340303","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811000/470d4fb6e395e70afa201065e49554644e69e5aa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759340303","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo is fully feature complete and comparable to the full game, being set in an exclusive level only playable in the demo. Learn the basics of the game in the tutorial, and solve 4 unique Cairn Stacks  in the bespoke level set in rural Outback Australia. As development of the full game continues, this demo will get improvements and updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is <i>Cairns</i>?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cairns</i> is the exemplary stone balancing simulation game. Travel to diverse and breathtaking outdoor environments, where each Cairn Stack is a self contained physics puzzle requiring Balance, Patience and Perfection to solve and progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811000/extras/b7c9688350e2ff855c35d58403ebdc6e.poster.avif?t=1759340303\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811000/extras/b7c9688350e2ff855c35d58403ebdc6e.webm?t=1759340303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811000/extras/b7c9688350e2ff855c35d58403ebdc6e.mp4?t=1759340303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cairns</i> features over 100 hand-crafted puzzling Stacks to solve and complete, across 5 glorious outdoor environments, offering\u00a0a significant amount to play, learn and master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself into the ancient practice of building Cairns, in an environmentally safe and non-destructive way. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the rewarding satisfaction of balancing the physics simulated stones in a freestanding Stack to reach the target height, unlocking greater challenges and new environments.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on achievement through intuitive controls and improved quality of life features like Undo / Redo and Pinning Stones in place.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immortalize and share your success of perfection with Photo mode, or just take in the glory of nature with full Environment Controls</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Balance</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The foundation of achieving success in <i>Cairns</i> is achieving Balance. Maintaining the placement of each stone, their order, and the center of gravity is necessary to complete each Cairn Stack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811000/extras/d87734f7e013cfa4d14475f4713d78b1.poster.avif?t=1759340303\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811000/extras/d87734f7e013cfa4d14475f4713d78b1.webm?t=1759340303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811000/extras/d87734f7e013cfa4d14475f4713d78b1.mp4?t=1759340303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accurately simulated real time physics makes balancing stones intuitive, and every Cairn Stack has been carefully designed to be challenging yet achievable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Patience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patience is necessary to overcome the hurdles and frustrations of failure, and push through to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An emphasis on designing a high quality of life experience is at the heart of <i>Cairns</i>, making mistakes educational rather than painful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811000/extras/0fd1820edd3b8acba063dcab500da86e.poster.avif?t=1759340303\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811000/extras/0fd1820edd3b8acba063dcab500da86e.webm?t=1759340303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811000/extras/0fd1820edd3b8acba063dcab500da86e.mp4?t=1759340303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What makes <i>Cairns</i> pleasant and flowing are features like</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive camera and Stone controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undo and Redo </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pinning Stones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-saving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photo Mode and Environment Controls</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Perfection</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Striving for Perfection, and achieving it, is the most satisfying measure of ability. It is not enough to simply reach a Stack's goal height. Challenge yourself to go above and beyond, perhaps using every stone, or the least amount of stones, as quickly as possible, or with as few moves as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811000/extras/6d9c883c04a123db96841b4d47637781.poster.avif?t=1759340303\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811000/extras/6d9c883c04a123db96841b4d47637781.webm?t=1759340303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811000/extras/6d9c883c04a123db96841b4d47637781.mp4?t=1759340303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow things down and focus. <i>Cairns</i> is the perfect<i>\u00a0</i>game to lose yourself in, and promises a calm, mindful, challenging and rewarding experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["kaijuStomp"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3810840","name":"Cairns"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse